<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 06-JAN.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 06-JAN.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone Drena is in the eastern Coral Sea. Top winds are near 140 mph. The storm is centered near 17s/159e and is moving southwest at 4 mph. A turn to the south is expected while the storm begins to weaken slowly this period. By 48 hours, the storm should be west of New Caledonia. The main threat from Drena will be to shipping this period.</p>
</text>
